[0.084, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhere a step's time goes\u001b[22m (the profile of\u001b[44Ga cru\u001b[50Gsing step, after today's 2× fix):\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GAbout 85% is Jettison'\u001b[29Gmovement: Jolt stepping each stat\u001b[63Gon's\u001b[68Gphysics\u001b[76Gworld,\u001b[83Gthe station'\u001b[96G kinematic\u001b[107Gpads\u001b[112Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdecks, \u001b[13Ghe\u001b[16Gdoc\u001b[20G buggies driving their roads,\u001b[50Gthe spatial\u001b[62Gindex\u001b[68Gand the\u001b[76Gcruise placing the \u001b[96Ghip.\u001b[101G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GManifest's\u001b[16Gmarket,\u001b[24Geconomy,\u001b[33Gobservations\u001b[46Gand\u001b[50Gcompany\u001b[58Gare\u001b[62Gabout\u001b[68G3\u001b[70Gto\u001b[73G5%\u001b[76Gtogether.\u001b[86GThe\u001b[90Glargest\u001b[98Gof\u001b[101Gthem,\u001b[107G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTrade::Step\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gis 1.7%.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThere\u001b[11Gare\u001b[15Gno\u001b[18Gtraders\u001b[26Gor\u001b[29GAI\u001b[32Gin\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Ghosted\u001b[46Gworld\u001b[52Gyet;\u001b[57GW10\u001b[61Gadds\u001b[66GNPC\u001b[70Gjobs.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo\u001b[6Grunning\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Geconomy\u001b[26Gless\u001b[31Goften\u001b[37Gwould\u001b[43Gsave\u001b[48Gat\u001b[51Gmost\u001b[56Gabout\u001b[62G5%.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSame results in fewer steps\u001b[22m is pos\u001b[38Gible in principle, but not by giving \u001b[76Gystems their own rates. H\u001b[102Gre, \"the same\" has\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto mean bit-iden\u001b[20Gical: r\u001b[28Gplay acros\u001b[39G builds, saves and \u001b[59Ghe\u001b[62Gserver all assume a\u001b[82Gworld \u001b[89Gtepped\u001b[96GN times is exactly\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsa\u001b[8Gwo\u001b[11Gld,\u001b[15Gand\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Gpinned world\u001b[36Ghashes\u001b[43Gcheck\u001b[49Git.\u001b[53GA\u001b[55