[18Gto\u001b[21GH05, wher\u001b[31G th\u001b[35G sa\u001b[39Gple's content leaves the engine. |\u001b[74G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m347\u001b[12G\u001b[22m|\u001b[14GIndependent\u001b[26GCPU consumer | H04 (1) | A non-space CPU consume\u001b[75G defines, \u001b[86Gteps, saves, loads and \u001b[111Gars\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B down\u001b[19Ghrough\u001b[26Gt\u001b[29G public host, with no ga\u001b[54Gaxy, transform or\u001b[72Gstar\u001b[77Gsystem.\u001b[85G**Done**\u001b[94G2026-11-18:\u001b[106G`source/\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22mtest/consumer` fet\u001b[31Ghe\u001b[34G the\u001b[39Gengine with\u001b[51G`JETTISON_PRESENTATION` off a\u001b[81Gd Vulkan refus\u001b[96Gd\u001b[99Gand runs a r\u001b[112Gce\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1B(a `Piece` definition read from its \u001b[50Gwn conten\u001b[60G directory,\u001b[72Ga `Token` compone\u001b[90Gt, a `Place` command, a\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bstepped \u001b[21Gystem\u001b[27Gthat rolls the world's generator) through `Host::Session`: a second session\u001b[103Gfrom\u001b[108Gthe sa\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bme seed and\u001b[24Gcommands reaches the\u001b[45Gsame state hash, a third lo\u001b[73Gds th\u001b[79G save and reaches it too, and teard\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bown runs world\u001b[27Gbefore game. Its link line n\u001b[56Gmes no presentation library and\u001b[88Gno sampl\u001b[97G content; i\u001b[109G need\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bs an \u001b[18Gxplicit `JETTISON_SOURCE_DIR`\u001b[76Gmain` fallback gon\u001b[95G.\u001b[97GI\u001b[100Gis a\u001b[105Gmanual ch\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;12H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.015, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Birectory and its pack, fails each phase in turn with \u001b[66Go later hook run, tea\u001b[88Gs down world before gam\u001b[112G,\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Band ru\u001b[19Gs two sessions side by sid\u001b[46G and \u001b[52Gne after a failure. |\u001b[74G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m346\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| CPU-only bu\u001b[26Gld\u001b[29G| H03\u001b[35G(1) |\u001b[41GThe engin\u001b[52Gconfigures without ImGui/Vulkan/glslc/sample assets, its CPU m\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bodules and their suite\u001b[35G build\u001b[42Gan\u001b[45G p\u001b[48Gss, and th\u001b[59G p\u001b[62Gcker stays available.\u001b[84G**Done**\u001b[93G2026-11-18:\u001b[105G`JETTISON\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22m_PRESENTATION` (ON\u001b[31Gby default) gates the presentation m\u001b[68Gdules, the assets, Flotsam, Jet\u001b[100Gam, the render\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B harness and the\u001b[29Glibraries only they use, replacing `PLUGIN_IMGUI`, which had returned before the engi\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bne was defined; the `clang-cpu` pr\u001b[48Ge\u001b[50G refuses `find_packag\u001b[72G(Vulkan)`, and\u001b[87Gits fresh configure fetch\u001b[113Gd\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1Bnone of\u001b[21GGLFW, FreeType, RmlUi,\u001b[44Gminia\u001b[50Gdio, ImGui, stb, VMA or KTX, built in 720 steps and passed its 2\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B2 suites; th\u001b[25G ga\u001b[29Ge configures, builds and tests it. S\u001b[66Glitting renderer\u001b[83Gresources from example con\u001b[110Gent\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bmoved\u001b[18Gto\u001b[21GH05, wher\u001b[31G th\u001b[35G sa\u001b[39Gple's content leaves the engine. |\u001b[74G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m347\u001b[12G\u001b[22m|\u001b[14GIndependent\u001b[26GCPU consumer | H04 (1) | A non-space CPU consume\u001b[75G defines, \u001b[86Gteps, saves, loads and \u001b[111Gars\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B down\u001b[19Ghrough\u001b[26Gt\u001b[29G public host, with no ga\u001b[54Gaxy, transform or\u001b[72Gstar\u001b[77Gsystem.\u001b[85G**Done**\u001b[94G2026-11-18:\u001b[106G`source/\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22mtest/consumer` fet\u001b[31Ghe\u001b[34G the\u001b[39Gengine with\u001b[51G`JETTISON_PRESENTATION` off a\u001b[81Gd Vulkan refus\u001b[96Gd\u001b[99Gand runs a r\u001b[112Gce\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1B(a `Piece` definition read from its \u001b[50Gwn conten\u001b[60G directory,\u001b[72Ga `Token` compone\u001b[90Gt, a `Place` command, a\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bstepped \u001b[21Gystem\u001b[27Gthat rolls the world's generator) through `Host::Session`: a second session\u001b[103Gfrom\u001b[108Gthe sa\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bme seed and\u001b[24Gcommands reaches the\u001b[45Gsame state hash, a third lo\u001b[73Gds th\u001b[79G save and reaches it too, and teard\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bown runs world\u001b[27Gbefore game. Its link line n\u001b[56Gmes no presentation library and\u001b[88Gno sampl\u001b[97G content; i\u001b[109G need\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bs an \u001b[18Gxplicit `JETTISON_SOURCE_DIR` or `JETTISON_GIT_TAG`, the `main` fallback gon\u001b[95G.\u001b[97GI\u001b[100Gis a\u001b[105Gmanual ch\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Beck, not\u001b[21Ga gate stag\u001b[34G(\u001b[36G second\u001b[44Gfetch of the dependency set). |\u001b[76G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B     \u001b[12G \u001b[14G  \u001b[17G        \u001b[26G                     \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;12H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.321, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Band runs\u001b[21Gtwo\u001b[25Gse\u001b[28Gsions side by side and one\u001b[55Gafter a failure. |\u001b[74G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m346\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| CPU-only build | H03 (1)\u001b[39G| The \u001b[46Gngine configu\u001b[60Ges\u001b[63Gwithout ImGui/Vulkan/glslc/sample\u001b[97Gassets,\u001b[105Gits\u001b[109GCPU\u001b[113Gm\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22modules and\u001b[23Gtheir\u001b[29Gsuites build and pass,\u001b[52Gand the packer stays available. **Done** 2026-11-18:\u001b[105G`JETTISON\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B_PRESENTATION` (ON by defau\u001b[40Gt) gates the presentation modules, the assets, Flotsam, Jetsam, the render\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B harness and the li\u001b[32Graries only th\u001b[47Gy\u001b[49Gus\u001b[52G, \u001b[56Gplacing `PLUGIN_IMGUI`, which had returned before the engi\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bne was defined; the `clang-cpu`\u001b[44Gpr\u001b[47Gset refuses `find_package(Vulkan)`, and its fresh configure f\u001b[109Gtched\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B none of GLFW, Fre\u001b[31GType, RmlUi,\u001b[44Gminiaudio, ImGui, stb, VMA or KTX, built in 720 steps a\u001b[100Gd passed its 2\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B2 suites; the gat\u001b[30G configures, bu\u001b[46Glds and tests it. Splitting\u001b[74Grenderer resources from\u001b[98Gexam\u001b[103Gle content\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bmoved to H05,\u001b[26Gwhere the sample's content leave\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Geng\u001b[68Gne. |\u001b[74G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m347\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| In\u001b[17Gependent\u001b[26GCPU consumer | H04\u001b[45G(1) | A\u001b[53Gnon-space CPU consumer\u001b[76Gdefines,\u001b[85Gsteps,\u001b[92Gsaves,\u001b[99Gloads\u001b[105Gand\u001b[109Gtears\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22m down through\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Gpublic host, with no\u001b[51Ggalaxy, transform or star syst\u001b[82Gm.\u001b[85G**Done** 2026-11-18: `source/\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Btest/consumer` f\u001b[29Gtches the engine with\u001b[51G`JETTISON_PRESENTATION` off and Vulkan refused, and runs a \u001b[111Gace\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B (a `Piece` definition\u001b[35Gread from its own content directory, a `Token` component, a `Place`\u001b[103Gcommand, a\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bstepped system tha\u001b[31G rolls the world's genera\u001b[57Gor)\u001b[61Gth\u001b[64Gough `Host::Session`: a second\u001b[95Gsession\u001b[103Gfro\u001b[107G the\u001b[112Gsa\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bme se\u001b[20Gand commands reaches the same\u001b[50Gstate hash, a third l\u001b[72Gads the save and reache\u001b[96G it too, and t\u001b[111Gard\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bown runs world before g\u001b[36Gme. I\u001b[42Gs link line name\u001b[59G no presentation\u001b[76Glibrary and no sample content; it nee\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bs an explicit `JETTISON_SOURCE_DIR` or `JETTISON_GIT_TAG`, \u001b[72Ghe `main` fallback\u001b[91Ggone. It is a manual ch\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Beck,\u001b[17Gnot a gate stage (a second fetch of the dependency set). |\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/roadmap.md)\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;12H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.039, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m346\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| CPU-only build | H03 (1)\u001b[39G| The \u001b[46Gngine configu\u001b[60Ges\u001b[63Gwithout ImGui/Vulkan/glslc/sample\u001b[97Gassets,\u001b[105Gits\u001b[109GCPU\u001b[113Gm\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22modules and\u001b[23Gtheir\u001b[29Gsuites build and pass,\u001b[52Gand the packer stays available. **Done** 2026-11-18:\u001b[105G`JETTISON\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B_PRESENTATION` (ON by defau\u001b[40Gt) gates the presentation modules, the assets, Flotsam, Jetsam, the render\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B harness and the li\u001b[32Graries only th\u001b[47Gy\u001b[49Gus\u001b[52G, \u001b[56Gplacing `PLUGIN_IMGUI`, which had returned before the engi\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bne was defined; the `clang-cpu`\u001b[44Gpr\u001b[47Gset refuses `find_package(Vulkan)`, and its fresh configure f\u001b[109Gtched\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B none of GLFW, Fre\u001b[31GType, RmlUi,\u001b[44Gminiaudio, ImGui, stb, VMA or KTX, built in 720 steps a\u001b[100Gd passed its 2\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B2 suites; the gat\u001b[30G configures, bu\u001b[46Glds and tests it. Splitting\u001b[74Grenderer resources from\u001b[98Gexam\u001b[103Gle content\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bmoved to H05,\u001b[26Gwhere the sample's content leave\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Geng\u001b[68Gne. |\u001b[74G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m347\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| In\u001b[17Gependent\u001b[26GCPU consumer | H04\u001b[45G(1) | A\u001b[53Gnon-space CPU consumer\u001b[76Gdefines,\u001b[85Gsteps,\u001b[92Gsaves,\u001b[99Gloads\u001b[105Gand\u001b[109Gtears\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22m down through\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Gpublic host, with no\u001b[51Ggalaxy, transform or star syst\u001b[82Gm.\u001b[85G**Done** 2026-11-18: `source/\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Btest/consumer` f\u001b[29Gtches the engine with\u001b[51G`JETTISON_PRESENTATION` off and Vulkan refused, and runs a \u001b[111Gace\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B (a `Piece` definition\u001b[35Gread from its own content directory, a `Token` component, a `Place`\u001b[103Gcommand, a\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bstepped system tha\u001b[31G rolls the world's genera\u001b[57Gor)\u001b[61Gth\u001b[64Gough `Host::Session`: a second\u001b[95Gsession\u001b[103Gfro\u001b[107G the\u001b[112Gsa\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bme se\u001b[20Gand commands reaches the same\u001b[50Gstate hash, a third l\u001b[72Gads the save and reache\u001b[96G it too, and t\u001b[111Gard\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bown runs world before g\u001b[36Gme. I\u001b[42Gs link line name\u001b[59G no presentation\u001b[76Glibrary and no sample content; it nee\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bs an explicit `JETTISON_SOURCE_DIR` or `JETTISON_GIT_TAG`, \u001b[72Ghe `main` fallback\u001b[91Ggone. It is a manual ch\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Beck,\u001b[17Gnot a gate stage (a second fetch of the dependency set). |\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/roadmap.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdde\u001b[11G \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m lines, re\u001b[24Goved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m2\u001b[31G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;12H\u001b[?25h"]
