[0.015, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bne was defined; the `clang-cpu` pr\u001b[48Ge\u001b[50G refuses `find_packag\u001b[72G(Vulkan)`, and\u001b[87Gits fresh configure fetch\u001b[113Gd\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1Bnone of\u001b[21GGLFW, FreeType, RmlUi,\u001b[44Gminia\u001b[50Gdio, ImGui, stb, VMA or KTX, built in 720 steps and passed its 2\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B2 suites; th\u001b[25G ga\u001b[29Ge configures, builds and tests it. S\u001b[66Glitting renderer\u001b[83Gresources from example con\u001b[110Gent\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bmoved\u001b[18Gto\u001b[21GH05, wher\u001b[31G th\u001b[35G sa\u001b[39Gple's content leaves the engine. |\u001b[74G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m347\u001b[12G\u001b[22m|\u001b[14GIndependent\u001b[26GCPU consumer | H04 (1) | A non-space CPU consume\u001b[75G defines, \u001b[86Gteps, saves, loads and \u001b[111Gars\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B down\u001b[19Ghrough\u001b[26Gt\u001b[29G public host, with no ga\u001b[54Gaxy, transform or\u001b[72Gstar\u001b[77Gsystem.\u001b[85G**Done**\u001b[94G2026-11-18:\u001b[106G`source/\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22mtest/consumer` fet\u001b[31Ghe\u001b[34G the\u001b[39Gengine with\u001b[51G`JETTISON_PRESENTATION` off a\u001b[81Gd Vulkan refus\u001b[96Gd\u001b[99Gand runs a r\u001b[112Gce\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1B(a `Piece` definition read from its \u001b[50Gwn conten\u001b[60G directory,\u001b[72Ga `Token` compone\u001b[90Gt, a `Place` command, a\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bstepped \u001b[21Gystem\u001b[27Gthat rolls the world's generator) through `Host::Session`: a second session\u001b[103Gfrom\u001b[108Gthe sa\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bme seed and\u001b[24Gcommands reaches the\u001b[45Gsame state hash, a third lo\u001b[73Gds th\u001b[79G save and reaches it too, and teard\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bown runs world\u001b[27Gbefore game. Its link line n\u001b[56Gmes no presentation library and\u001b[88Gno sampl\u001b[97G content; i\u001b[109G need\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bs an \u001b[18Gxplicit `JETTISON_SOURCE_DIR` or `JETTISON_GIT_TAG`, the `main` fallback gon\u001b[95G.\u001b[97GI\u001b[100Gis a\u001b[105Gmanual ch\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Beck, not\u001b[21Ga gate stag\u001b[34G(\u001b[36G second\u001b[44Gfetch of the dependency set). |\u001b[76G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/roadmap.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m5\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines,\u001b[21Gremoved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m2\u001b[31G\u001b[22mlines\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 35 \u001b[22m and s\u001b[17G is W06, station\u001b[34Glife\u001b[39Gsupport\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Gresupply\u001b[60G(2026-11-20,\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 36 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mhistory\u001b[39m](history.md#neutral-sdk-and-manifest-integration)),\u001b[72Gand\u001b[76Gso\u001b[79Gis\u001b[82GW07,\u001b[87Glive\u001b[92Gand\u001b[96Gstale\u001b[102Gmarket\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[11G\u001b[22mobservations (2026-11-20, [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mhistory\u001b[39m](history.md#neutral\u001b[66Gsdk-and-manifest-integration)),\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102Gso\u001b[105Gis\u001b[108GW08,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 38 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcompany-funded cargo upgrades (2026-\u001b[76Geutral-sdk-and-manifest-integration)).\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;12H\u001b[?25h"]
