[0.030, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 76 \u001b[22m   player's event sends as that player, an NPC's as that NPC, and no client or script can name\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 77 \u001b[22m   another player or an NPC. It also reaches a `Sim::Controller` nested inside a command's fields,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 78 \u001b[22m   which the host does not yet stamp.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m79\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m-\u001b[13G**A fast-forward over\u001b[35Gquiet steps** (the user's,\u001b[62G2026-11-20,\u001b[74Gafter Manifest's L26): a cruising    \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m0\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mst\u001b[16Gp of Manifes\u001b[29G's is\u001b[35G13 µs,\u001b[42Gnearly all of\u001b[56Git\u001b[59Gthe engine's movement (Jolt's upd\u001b[93Gte of each\u001b[104Gframe's\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m1\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mw\u001b[15Grld, the\u001b[24Gdocks and their buggies, the\u001b[53Gspatial i\u001b[63Gdex, the cru\u001b[77Ge's placing) and under 5% the\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m2\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mgame's, so a 4.49-day cruise is 23 million steps\u001b[62Gof motion a\u001b[74Gformula could\u001b[88Gplace. Each\u001b[100Gsyst\u001b[105Gm\u001b[107Gsays\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m3\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mt\u001b[15Ge next\u001b[22Gst\u001b[25Gp it must run at (a batch due, an\u001b[59Gorder \u001b[66Gap\u001b[69Ging, a\u001b[76Gjourn\u001b[82Gy ending, a c\u001b[96Gntact   \u001b[105G    \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m4\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mpossible), and th\u001b[31G world, while no\u001b[48Ghing\u001b[53Gbut\u001b[57Gmotion by formula is und\u001b[82Gr way\u001b[88G(orbit\u001b[95G, rails, a \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m5\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcru\u001b[17Gs\u001b[19G placed by its time), goes \u001b[47Gtraight to the soonest,\u001b[71Gt\u001b[73G the sam\u001b[82G bits as\u001b[91Gstepping there:  \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m6\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mphysics, the \u001b[27Gocks\u001b[32Ga\u001b[34Gd\u001b[36Gth\u001b[39G buggi\u001b[46Gs each\u001b[53Gprove themselves quie\u001b[75G or are placed in c\u001b[95Gosed form\u001b[105Gover\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 87 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  the gap. It changes what a system tells the step, so it is dearer the more systems there are:        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 88 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  decided before Manifest's W10 adds traders' and NPC jobs' work to every step. Tested by a world      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 89 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  fast-forwarded and one stepped reaching the same state hash, the pinned hashes holding.              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 90 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 91 \u001b[11G\u001b[22m### Next: what the game's next slices stand on\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 92 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  (files that changed while this command ran, by the command or\u001b[68Gby another\u001b[79Gprocess; a convenience view, not\u001b[112Ga \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mreview or audit of\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gcommand)\r\u001b[13C\u001b[2B22m\u001b[18G33s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m55.9k\u001b[32Gtokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
