[0.058, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m  a reusable cost found in Jettison's systems is provisioned there. | Before the next task that plays a\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m  long journey through the console, at the latest W09's fixture. **Done 2026-11-20**, [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdelivered\u001b[39m](stage\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m -4-trading-plan.md#delivered-l26-2026-11-20). |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m260 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m| 81 / L27 | A fast-\u001b[33Gorward over quiet steps\u001b[57G([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL26\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](stage-4-trading-plan.md#delivered-l26-2026-11-20),\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m  \u001b[10G +\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthe use\u001b[21G's, 2026-11-20): a cruising step is\u001b[57G13 µs, nearly all of\u001b[78Git J\u001b[83Gttison'\u001b[92Gm\u001b[94Gvement\u001b[101Gand\u001b[105Gunder\u001b[111G5%\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mManifest's systems, so running Manifest's own less often saves little. Jettison provisions the world g\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242moing straight to the next step any system must run at while nothing but motion by formula is under way\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m, to the same bits as stepping there ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mJettison's roadmap\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](../../jettison/docs/roadmap.md#first-what-s\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242maves-and-the-simulations-interface-hold)); Manifest's systems then say when they next must run (a batc\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mh due, an order lapsing, a journey ending), and its console and server use it. | Decided before W10, w\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;24